Ok I checked it and it seems that it always does the actor sprites etc, but it just doesn't load a bitmap there without MenuCore. So add this plugin below VS, then put in your pictures folder images for the actors for each actor id. Like Portrait1, Portrait2, Portrait3 etc. I think you can move the portrait around just making the png larger and moving the dude in there.
const _myEdit1_WindowVictoryLevelUp_setActor = Window_VictoryLevelUp.prototype.setActor;
Window_VictoryLevelUp.prototype.setActor = function(actor) {
_myEdit1_WindowVictoryLevelUp_setActor.call(this, actor);
this._actorSprite.bitmap = ImageManager.loadPicture("Portrait" + actor.actorId().toString());
};

